title: "Linear coordinate presentations of Lotka–Volterra tree systems and a proof of van der Kamp's tree conjecture"
type: software
authors:
  - name: Anonymous
version: 1.0.0-candidate
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23564794
date-released: 2026-10-22
repository-code: "https://github.com/ipitchford/lotka-volterra-tree-presentations"
url: "https://evidencepress.org/releases/lotka-volterra-tree-presentations/"
